    "How Win Win Car Audio collects, uses, and protects customer information.": "Win Win Car Audio 如何收集、使用和保护顾客信息。",
    "We may collect your name, phone number, email address, vehicle details, booking preferences, and order-related information when you use the website.": "当您使用本网站时，我们可能会收集您的姓名、电话号码、电子邮箱、车辆信息、预约偏好及订单相关信息。",
    "Your information is used to respond to enquiries, manage bookings, process orders, send confirmations, and improve the showroom experience.": "您的信息用于回复咨询、管理预约、处理订单、发送确认以及改善门店体验。",
    "We keep operational records only as long as needed for customer service, reporting, and legal or academic documentation requirements.": "我们仅在客户服务、报告及法律或学术文档要求所需的时间内保留运营记录。",
    "We do not sell personal data. Information may only be shared with service providers such as email delivery tools when needed to operate the system.": "我们不出售个人数据。信息仅可在运营系统所需时与电子邮件发送工具等服务提供商共享。",
    "You may contact the store to request updates or corrections to your submitted details, subject to operational and legal limits.": "您可以联系门店申请更新或更正您提交的信息，但须遵守运营和法律限制。",

    "Terms of Service": "服务条款",
    "1. Product Information": "1. 产品信息",
    "2. Bookings": "2. 预约",
    "3. Orders": "3. 订单",
    "4. Website Usage": "4. 网站使用",
    "5. Contact": "5. 联系方式",
    "General terms for browsing, booking, and order-related actions on the website.": "网站浏览、预约及订单相关操作的一般条款。",
    "Product descriptions, prices, compatibility notes, and availability may change without notice. Customers should confirm final fitment and availability with the store.": "产品描述、价格、适配说明及库存情况可能随时更改，恕不另行通知。顾客应向门店确认最终适配性和货品供应情况。",
    "Submitting a booking request does not guarantee a completed service until the appointment is confirmed by the store. Customers should arrive on time and provide accurate vehicle details.": "提交预约申请并不保证服务完成，直至门店确认预约为止。顾客须准时到达并提供准确的车辆信息。",
    "The system may demonstrate a mock checkout flow for capstone purposes. Final real-world fulfilment remains subject to store confirmation and stock availability.": "本系统可能展示模拟结账流程用于毕业设计目的。实际订单履行仍须视门店确认及库存情况而定。",
    "Users must not misuse the website, attempt unauthorized access, or submit false information through forms, chat, or booking flows.": "用户不得滥用本网站、尝试未经授权的访问，或通过表单、聊天或预约流程提交虚假信息。",
    "For urgent requests, latest pricing, or product verification, please contact Win Win Car Audio directly via WhatsApp or visit the showroom.": "如有紧急需求、最新报价或产品确认，请直接通过 WhatsApp 联系 Win Win Car Audio 或前往门店。",

